# Secrets - NEVER commit these
# NOTE: service/src/claude.js used to be listed here because it once held API
# keys inline. It has since been reduced to a 306-byte re-export shim over
# llm.js with no secrets in it, while the ignore rule stayed. Because
# memory/consolidation.js imports it, every fresh `git clone` crashed on boot
# with ERR_MODULE_NOT_FOUND. Un-ignored and committed 2026-08-07. Real secrets
# now live in settings/env, not in source.
.env
*.credentials.json

